  "subject": "Neue E-Mail bestätigen – Dashday",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"de\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\" />\n  <title>E-Mail bestätigen – Dashday</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#eef1f6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#eef1f6;padding:32px 16px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(18,31,56,0.08);\">\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 32px 12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#121f38 0%,#1a2d52 100%);\">\n              <img src=\"https://dashday.io/assets/icon-512.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" alt=\"Dashday\" style=\"display:block;border:0;border-radius:16px;\" />\n              <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#ffffff;\">Dashday</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:32px 32px 8px;color:#121f38;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#121f38;\">E-Mail bestätigen</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d4a63;\">\n                Willkommen bei Dashday. Tippe auf den Button, um deine E-Mail zu bestätigen und Sync freizuschalten.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 28px;\">\n              <a href=\"{{CONFIRMATION_URL}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#ff7347;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:12px;\">E-Mail bestätigen</a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 32px 28px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b778c;\">\n                Wenn der Button nicht funktioniert, öffne diesen Link (Browser oder Dashday):<br />\n                <a href=\"{{CONFIRMATION_URL}}\" style=\"color:#ff7347;word-break:break-all;\">{{CONFIRMATION_URL}}</a>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 32px 32px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#8b95a8;\">\n                Falls du keinen Account erstellt hast, kannst du diese Mail ignorieren.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n        <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#8b95a8;\">\n          <a href=\"https://dashday.io\" style=\"color:#8b95a8;text-decoration:none;\">dashday.io</a>\n          · mediawaves services GmbH\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
